we should then change the name of rtg33inv throughout, because if this is allowed to be signed, it doesn't make sense to call it the (square) root of G^33. Maybe just call it B3overB.

Note, I think you are gonna have to change the collisionless GK maxima and associated kernels. It's a bit of work, but it's important for these things to be consistent.

